  "note": "Vocabulary and word-shapes for the names the app suggests. Source of truth for src/lib/handles.generated.ts via scripts/gen-handles.mjs. Never edit the generated file; edit this and run `npm run handles`.",
  "voiceNotes": {
    "calm": "A provider's stage name is what a stranger reads at 2am while looking for someone steady. Weather, water, kitchens, courtyards, trees and birds. No numbers in three of its four shapes.",
    "pop": "A member's username is a handle: theirs, playful, and nobody picks a listener by reading it. Indian popular culture, kept to ordinary words that happen to carry weight (masala, jugaad, googly, jalebi) and to fictional names, never a performer's."
